Subject: Aircraft-specific truncation to address different blind spots
Message-ID: <IU-7aKqc-YA.riicKIy4BAAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/distance-sampling/c/IU-7aKqc-YA/m/riicKIy4BAAJ>
